{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3f1c2a4-1d55-4c7a-9f21-5c0a7e2d0001",
    "name": "SUS - Plataforma Digital de Atendimento",
    "description": "Hackathon FIAP - Grupo 32. Frente do Luis: IAM (001) e Cadastros (002).\n\n## Como usar\n1. Suba o ambiente: `docker compose up --build`\n2. Selecione o environment **SUS - Local** (ou ajuste a variavel `baseUrl`).\n3. Rode **1. Autenticacao > Login (administrador)**. O token e salvo automaticamente e usado por todas as demais requisicoes.\n4. Rode as pastas na ordem numerica: cada uma guarda os ids que a seguinte usa.\n\nA pasta **8. Testes de seguranca** demonstra o controle de acesso: 401 sem token, 403 por perfil e 404 ao tentar ler dado de outro paciente.\n\nUsuario inicial (criado na primeira subida): `admin@sus.gov.br` / `Admin@123`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl')) {",
          "    pm.collectionVariables.set('baseUrl', 'http://localhost:8080');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@sus.gov.br", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminSenha", "value": "Admin@123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tokenPaciente", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "usuarioLogadoId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "usuarioPacienteId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "usuarioMedicoId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "pacienteId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "medicoId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "especialidadeId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000e1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "unidadeSaudeId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000b1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tipoExameId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000c1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "emailPaciente", "value": "maria.souza@sus.gov.br", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "senhaPaciente", "value": "Paciente@123", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autenticacao",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (administrador)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const corpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devolve token', () => pm.expect(corpo.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test('nao devolve senha', () => pm.expect(JSON.stringify(corpo)).to.not.include('Admin@123'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', corpo.token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioLogadoId', corpo.usuario.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{adminSenha}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Rota publica. Guarda o token na variavel `token` da colecao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Meus dados",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('nao expoe a senha', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('senha'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar perfis (roles)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/roles", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "roles"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Usuarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuario - paciente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const corpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioPacienteId', corpo.id);",
                  "pm.test('perfil PACIENTE atribuido', () => pm.expect(corpo.roles).to.include('PACIENTE'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Souza\",\n  \"cpf\": \"11144477735\",\n  \"email\": \"{{emailPaciente}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{senhaPaciente}}\",\n  \"roles\": [\"PACIENTE\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios"] },
            "description": "Exige ADMINISTRADOR. O id gerado vai para `usuarioPacienteId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuario - medico",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioMedicoId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Carlos Lima\",\n  \"cpf\": \"12345678909\",\n  \"email\": \"carlos.lima@sus.gov.br\",\n  \"senha\": \"Medico@123\",\n  \"roles\": [\"MEDICO\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuario - CPF invalido (422)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422 Unprocessable Entity', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('erro em formato RFC 7807', () => {",
                  "    const corpo = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(corpo).to.have.property('title');",
                  "    pm.expect(corpo).to.have.property('status');",
                  "    pm.expect(corpo).to.have.property('detail');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Teste CPF\",\n  \"cpf\": \"11111111111\",\n  \"email\": \"teste.cpf@sus.gov.br\",\n  \"senha\": \"Senha@123\",\n  \"roles\": [\"ATENDENTE\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios"] },
            "description": "Demonstra a validacao de dominio (RN-02) e o formato de erro RFC 7807."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios?termo=&role=&ativo=true&pagina=0&tamanho=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "termo", "value": "", "description": "Nome, e-mail ou CPF" },
                { "key": "role", "value": "", "description": "ADMINISTRADOR, ATENDENTE, MEDICO ou PACIENTE" },
                { "key": "ativo", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "pagina", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "tamanho", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar usuario por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuarioPacienteId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios", "{{usuarioPacienteId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Souza Andrade\",\n  \"email\": \"{{emailPaciente}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuarioPacienteId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios", "{{usuarioPacienteId}}"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atribuir perfis",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"roles\": [\"PACIENTE\"]\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuarioPacienteId}}/roles",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios", "{{usuarioPacienteId}}", "roles"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Alterar senha (administrador redefine)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"novaSenha\": \"{{senhaPaciente}}\"\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuarioPacienteId}}/senha",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios", "{{usuarioPacienteId}}", "senha"]
            },
            "description": "O administrador redefine sem informar a senha atual. O proprio usuario precisa informa-la."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Inativar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/usuarios/{{usuarioPacienteId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "usuarios", "{{usuarioPacienteId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Inativacao logica (204). Nao rode antes das pastas seguintes, senao o paciente nao consegue autenticar."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
